  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A two point charges <math><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow></math> and <math><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></math> are fixed on the <math><mi>x</mi></math> -axis at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>, respectively. If the third point charge &lsquo;<math><mi>q</mi></math> &rsquo; is taken from the origin to <math><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></math> along the semicircle as shown in the figure, the energy of the charge will:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8eb1910b-51d4-4276-867b-bdbb013eed2c-image.png\" style=\"width: 231px; height: 140px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
